### CollectionPoints — CREATE (expects 201 Created; routeId must be an active route)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@routeId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collection-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Punto Plaza de Mercado",
  "routeId": {{routeId}},
  "address": "Calle 2 # 7-45, Riohacha",
  "description": "Punto de acopio junto a la plaza de mercado",
  "status": "active"
}

### CollectionPoints — CREATE with a missing route (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collection-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Punto sin ruta",
  "routeId": 999999
}

### CollectionPoints — CREATE duplicate name on the same route (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collection-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Punto Plaza de Mercado",
  "routeId": {{routeId}}
}
